{"_id":"6a2ff5af2204ffbc59e5a647","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"w4K_ffCUbzhGxWyoKsspu","description":"# BeautifulSoup\n\nBeautifulSoup is a Python library for parsing HTML and XML documents. It provides methods for navigating the document tree, searching for elements by tag, class, or attribute, and extracting text and links. BeautifulSoup is used for web scraping when the target website does not provide an API.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Beautiful Soup Documentation","url":"https://beautiful-soup-4.readthedocs.io/en/latest/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec0a"},{"type":"article","title":"Beautiful Soup: Build a Web Scraper With Python","url":"https://realpython.com/beautiful-soup-web-scraper-python/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec0b"},{"type":"video","title":"Web Scraping with Python - Beautiful Soup Crash Course","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XVv6mJpFOb0","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec0c"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:53:03.200Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/w4K_ffCUbzhGxWyoKsspu.md"}